ge, and the pipeline completed successfully. Overall: **yes, mostly as expected**, and the **`file_path` extraction/download/send path worked** — I extracted the analyzer image URL from the Image Analyzer `file_path`, downloaded it, and prepared it for this Telegram reply.\n\nMEDIA:./kidney-pipeline-last-heatmap.jpeg\n\nWhat matched expectations:\n- HTTP status: `200`\n- kidney detector returned:\n  - `classes`: `kidney_tumor`\n  - `confidence`: `0.9999794960021973`\n- image analyzer returned:\n  - `cam_metrics`\n  - `prediction`: `kidney_tumor`\n  - `cam_explanation`\n  - `file_path` containing the heatmap URL\n- X-AI returned:\n  - `confidence_interpretation`\n  - `recommended_next_steps`\n  - `visual_evidence`\n\nWhat did **not** fully match the revised contract:\n- `inference_time` came through as **`\"Inference time\"`** in the live response, not `inference_time`\n  - because of that, the derived `module_reference_metrics.kidney_cancer_detector.inference_time` is currently `null`\n- `references_summary` is **not** present in the live response\n  - the live response still returns separate `references` and `summary`\n  - because of that, `module_reference_metrics.xai.references_summary` is currently `null`\n\nImportant check on `file_path`:\n- live field was:\n  - `\"[URL]http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/...jpeg\"`\n- the script correctly extracted the URL from that string\n- it downloaded the image successfully\n- it wrote the reply-ready file to:\n  - `./kidney-pipeline-last-heatmap.jpeg`\n- and I’m sending that image back here now\n\nSo my assessment is:\n- **execution flow is correct**\n- **image extraction from `file_path` is correct**\n- **Telegram reply image path is correct**\n- but the **live API field names still differ a bit from the new SKILL.md contract**\n\nNext sensible step:\n- I should make the script a bit more tolerant so it maps:\n  - `Inference time` → `inference_time`\n  - `references` + `summary` → a derived `references_summary` fallback\nThat would make the runtime output fully coherent with the new skill doc without breaking the current live response handling.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_054fecacb6ab011b0169baad64eabc81919f94b371cd83c36f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":10200,"output":641,"cacheRead":24192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35033,"cost":{"input":0.025500000000000002,"output":0.009615,"cacheRead":0.0060479999999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.041163}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773841757869}}
